(5089620, 742805, 31535, '<td valign="top">I love meat just as much as the next guy, but that does not look appetizing.<br/> <br/>The shot overall is well exposed and the composition is good. One thing I''d like to suggest is to ease up on the sharpening. It''s easy to go overboard. I''ve done it many times before. 6</td>', 'I love meat just as much as the next guy, but that does not look appetizing. The shot overall is well exposed and the composition is good. One thing I''d like to suggest is to ease up on the sharpening. It''s easy to go overboard. I''ve done it many times before. 6', '2008-11-29 01:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089624, 742745, 31535, '<td valign="top">I think a better angle to shoot these would be from higher up to avoid the clutter in the background.</td>', 'I think a better angle to shoot these would be from higher up to avoid the clutter in the background.', '2008-11-29 01:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
