(5089649, 742541, 31535, '<td valign="top">This shot has some real potential. I''s one of the better ones I''ve seen so far, but I think it could use a little boost in exposure. Maybe a little saturation as well to make that carrot and corn pop. 8</td>', 'This shot has some real potential. I''s one of the better ones I''ve seen so far, but I think it could use a little boost in exposure. Maybe a little saturation as well to make that carrot and corn pop. 8', '2008-11-29 01:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089653, 742825, 31535, '<td valign="top">Be reasonable! There would be no wine or cake left, maybe just the apple. :)<br/> <br/>Focus seems to be an issue here. There are so many items in your shot, and my eyes are not drawn to anything. It seems cluttered.</td>', 'Be reasonable! There would be no wine or cake left, maybe just the apple. :) Focus seems to be an issue here. There are so many items in your shot, and my eyes are not drawn to anything. It seems cluttered.', '2008-11-29 01:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
