(5091204, 742694, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Interesting tones too.</td>', 'Great perspective. Interesting tones too.', '2008-11-30 10:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091206, 742582, 33672, '<td valign="top">This looks like a photo from our dinner. Nice Pov and the B&amp;W works very well.</td>', 'This looks like a photo from our dinner. Nice Pov and the B&W works very well.', '2008-11-30 10:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091208, 742547, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nicely set up.</td>', 'Very nicely set up.', '2008-11-30 10:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091209, 742786, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting entries.</td>', 'One of the more interesting entries.', '2008-11-30 10:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091210, 742825, 33672, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes this photo very interesting.</td>', 'The lighting makes this photo very interesting.', '2008-11-30 10:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091246, 742694, 100975, '<td valign="top">This was a great idea for a photo.  I would have changed my vantage point to a lower position so that I could pick up more of the guest movement.  I am assuming that you used PS to adjust the colors in the foreground plate.  I also think that this was a good idea, however, it was muted by the food that was on the plate.  It seems like just a heap of mushy stuff and the arrangement/placement of the food takes away from the picture.</td>', 'This was a great idea for a photo.  I would have changed my vantage point to a lower position so that I could pick up more of the guest movement.  I am assuming that you used PS to adjust the colors in the foreground plate.  I also think that this was a good idea, however, it was muted by the food that was on the plate.  It seems like just a heap of mushy stuff and the arrangement/placement of the food takes away from the picture.', '2008-11-30 10:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091250, 742805, 100975, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Unfortunately it looks staged.  Would have been better if it was candid.</td>', 'Good idea.  Unfortunately it looks staged.  Would have been better if it was candid.', '2008-11-30 10:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091256, 742654, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the candle lit food, but I would have added a couple of more candles and placed the outside of the shot.  I think that it pulls my eye away from the food.  Also the other lighting that is being reflected in your glasses and salt and pepper shaker are distracting.  I would also remove the reflections in the cabinet window panes in the right background.</td>', 'I like the candle lit food, but I would have added a couple of more candles and placed the outside of the shot.  I think that it pulls my eye away from the food.  Also the other lighting that is being reflected in your glasses and salt and pepper shaker are distracting.  I would also remove the reflections in the cabinet window panes in the right background.', '2008-11-30 11:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091274, 742543, 100975, '<td valign="top">Overall not too bad.  Would have liked to see about 3/4" taken off the bottom so that the bottom edge is going through the glass plate.  Also a little more light on the food would be nice.</td>', 'Overall not too bad.  Would have liked to see about 3/4" taken off the bottom so that the bottom edge is going through the glass plate.  Also a little more light on the food would be nice.', '2008-11-30 11:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091281, 742590, 100975, '<td valign="top">Thanks for using a clean stove for the picture.  My suggestions:<br/>I would have cropped the photo on the left so that the edge would line up with the furthest tip of the upper left leaf in the blue square of the pot holder.  I would have also cropped the bottom of the photo to the furthest point on the bottom of the black line at the bottom of the pot holder.  I might have thrown a couple of fresh cranberries in the mix to pull your eye back into the dish and counteract the vibrant colors in the pot holder.</td>', 'Thanks for using a clean stove for the picture.  My suggestions:I would have cropped the photo on the left so that the edge would line up with the furthest tip of the upper left leaf in the blue square of the pot holder.  I would have also cropped the bottom of the photo to the furthest point on the bottom of the black line at the bottom of the pot holder.  I might have thrown a couple of fresh cranberries in the mix to pull your eye back into the dish and counteract the vibrant colors in the pot holder.', '2008-11-30 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091282, 742788, 100975, '<td valign="top">Would have taken the red cup out of the shot.</td>', 'Would have taken the red cup out of the shot.', '2008-11-30 11:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091297, 742582, 100975, '<td valign="top">Great natural light shot.</td>', 'Great natural light shot.', '2008-11-30 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091301, 742816, 100975, '<td valign="top">Really cute photo...one of my favorites.  Nothing about a feast though.</td>', 'Really cute photo...one of my favorites.  Nothing about a feast though.', '2008-11-30 12:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091309, 742701, 100975, '<td valign="top">Great shot with great color.  The picture flows from table design to plate design to olive to fork.  I am not onboard with the feast part, but I do have a justification for it.  This may or may not have been your intention, but I think that you could justify it by saying that the olive is a feast for the flower that looks as though it is about to consume it.</td>', 'Great shot with great color.  The picture flows from table design to plate design to olive to fork.  I am not onboard with the feast part, but I do have a justification for it.  This may or may not have been your intention, but I think that you could justify it by saying that the olive is a feast for the flower that looks as though it is about to consume it.', '2008-11-30 12:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091324, 742547, 100975, '<td valign="top">Would have cropped a little off the bottom so that the bottom edge is almost at the plate level.  I would have also used a shallower DOF so that everything behind the knives was blurry.  Also would have moved the front wine glass a little more off center.  Unfortunately the knives blend in with the background due to the lines in the window and the darkness in the bushes.<br/> <br/>Another idea would be to take the plate out of the shot and move the turkey platter to the right and the front wine glass to the left.</td>', 'Would have cropped a little off the bottom so that the bottom edge is almost at the plate level.  I would have also used a shallower DOF so that everything behind the knives was blurry.  Also would have moved the front wine glass a little more off center.  Unfortunately the knives blend in with the background due to the lines in the window and the darkness in the bushes. Another idea would be to take the plate out of the shot and move the turkey platter to the right and the front wine glass to the left.', '2008-11-30 12:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091329, 742651, 100975, '<td valign="top">I would drop the hat, lose the beer and the margarine, and iron the shirt.  I like how the rolls or whatever that is in the foreground looks.  I would have like to have seen more of the cello? in the shot and maybe a little more refined look.  Also would have panned to the left some to omit the white curtain in the background.</td>', 'I would drop the hat, lose the beer and the margarine, and iron the shirt.  I like how the rolls or whatever that is in the foreground looks.  I would have like to have seen more of the cello? in the shot and maybe a little more refined look.  Also would have panned to the left some to omit the white curtain in the background.', '2008-11-30 12:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091360, 742676, 100975, '<td valign="top">Would have taken the little guy off of the top right corner.</td>', 'Would have taken the little guy off of the top right corner.', '2008-11-30 12:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091370, 742582, 91527, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, the light looks <i>seriously</i> brilliant!!!</td>', 'Love this photo, the light looks seriously brilliant!!!', '2008-11-30 13:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091383, 742829, 100975, '<td valign="top">Concentrate more on the food.  Crop out the computer? under the table/desk.  Maybe take the shot to the front and drop down to a lower angle so that you can use the yellow wall as a nice bacground.  The fireplace is too much of a distraction.</td>', 'Concentrate more on the food.  Crop out the computer? under the table/desk.  Maybe take the shot to the front and drop down to a lower angle so that you can use the yellow wall as a nice bacground.  The fireplace is too much of a distraction.', '2008-11-30 13:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091384, 742653, 100975, '<td valign="top">I like the table, but the lighting isn''t strong enough for it.  Should have played with the food a little to have a stronger presentation.  Maybe through some fresh vegetables (other than the cucumber slices)on or around it.</td>', 'I like the table, but the lighting isn''t strong enough for it.  Should have played with the food a little to have a stronger presentation.  Maybe through some fresh vegetables (other than the cucumber slices)on or around it.', '2008-11-30 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091391, 742621, 100975, '<td valign="top">Picture lacks excitement or something.  Too much brownish tones for me.  One thing that I do see is the steam rising from the soup?  Lower lighting and a black background with just the soup with the steam could have been really nice.</td>', 'Picture lacks excitement or something.  Too much brownish tones for me.  One thing that I do see is the steam rising from the soup?  Lower lighting and a black background with just the soup with the steam could have been really nice.', '2008-11-30 13:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091396, 742823, 100975, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  Great idea with the coconut as snow.  Background should be blurred more and should have saved this one for a Christmas challenge or something.</td>', 'Great lighting.  Great idea with the coconut as snow.  Background should be blurred more and should have saved this one for a Christmas challenge or something.', '2008-11-30 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5091397, 742542, 100975, '<td valign="top">Nice centerpiece, but not a feast.</td>', 'Nice centerpiece, but not a feast.', '2008-11-30 13:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091401, 742601, 100975, '<td valign="top">Just a picture of a cat...</td>', 'Just a picture of a cat...', '2008-11-30 13:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091414, 742724, 100975, '<td valign="top">Pretty good photo.  Clean the knife and fork.  Replace the tin foil with something else.</td>', 'Pretty good photo.  Clean the knife and fork.  Replace the tin foil with something else.', '2008-11-30 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091497, 742540, 23845, '<td valign="top">curious, the places life takes us.</td>', 'curious, the places life takes us.', '2008-11-30 14:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091500, 742501, 23845, '<td valign="top">Bangers and Mash? Reminds me of my old Rugby days...</td>', 'Bangers and Mash? Reminds me of my old Rugby days...', '2008-11-30 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091502, 742750, 23845, '<td valign="top">Saskatowa Reisling... because a picture this artsy must mean the wine is great. <br/> <br/>Awesome shot! Seems very "New York City" to me.</td>', 'Saskatowa Reisling... because a picture this artsy must mean the wine is great.  Awesome shot! Seems very "New York City" to me.', '2008-11-30 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091503, 742788, 22538, '<td valign="top">Good work. Interesting slightly impressionist effect.</td>', 'Good work. Interesting slightly impressionist effect.', '2008-11-30 14:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091555, 742651, 39880, '<td valign="top">looks like a great meal.  All around good shot.</td>', 'looks like a great meal.  All around good shot.', '2008-11-30 15:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091557, 742731, 39880, '<td valign="top">My kind of feast.  I like the shallow DOF.</td>', 'My kind of feast.  I like the shallow DOF.', '2008-11-30 15:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091563, 742601, 39880, '<td valign="top">Unless you ate the cat, I''m not really getting feast out of this shot.  Otherwise I think it''s a nice pet portrait.</td>', 'Unless you ate the cat, I''m not really getting feast out of this shot.  Otherwise I think it''s a nice pet portrait.', '2008-11-30 15:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091566, 742788, 39880, '<td valign="top">A little small, but I do like the blur.</td>', 'A little small, but I do like the blur.', '2008-11-30 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091639, 742724, 98647, '<td valign="top">The out of focus foreground is distracting.</td>', 'The out of focus foreground is distracting.', '2008-11-30 16:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091643, 742540, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the subject. The man may be a little too central in the frame. Out of focus and grainy.</td>', 'I like the subject. The man may be a little too central in the frame. Out of focus and grainy.', '2008-11-30 16:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091646, 742823, 98647, '<td valign="top">Very sharp!! I like the colours and the lighting.</td>', 'Very sharp!! I like the colours and the lighting.', '2008-11-30 16:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5091647, 742826, 98647, '<td valign="top">Really like the depth of field with the out of focus fork.</td>', 'Really like the depth of field with the out of focus fork.', '2008-11-30 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092028, 742542, 86447, '<td valign="top">"Snap a fancy photograph of your Thanksgiving Feast. Or if you''re not celebrating Thanksgiving, simply photograph a nice meal you created."<br/> <br/>I see that it''s Thanksgiving related... but it''s not a photograph of any food... so... I''m sorry... to me it''s a DNMC.<br/> <br/>Still, it''s well done, so ... 5</td>', '"Snap a fancy photograph of your Thanksgiving Feast. Or if you''re not celebrating Thanksgiving, simply photograph a nice meal you created." I see that it''s Thanksgiving related... but it''s not a photograph of any food... so... I''m sorry... to me it''s a DNMC. Still, it''s well done, so ... 5', '2008-11-30 22:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092033, 742540, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful message... I wish it were sharper and less noisy... but I understand the difficulties.</td>', 'Beautiful message... I wish it were sharper and less noisy... but I understand the difficulties.', '2008-11-30 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092048, 742582, 47091, '<td valign="top">Thats what its all about</td>', 'Thats what its all about', '2008-11-30 22:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092051, 742701, 47091, '<td valign="top">Like the glass but I bet you are hungry</td>', 'Like the glass but I bet you are hungry', '2008-11-30 22:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092054, 742731, 47091, '<td valign="top">nice shot they have them now that are sausage and pancake batter my son loves them for breakfast.</td>', 'nice shot they have them now that are sausage and pancake batter my son loves them for breakfast.', '2008-11-30 22:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092063, 742700, 47091, '<td valign="top">I bet it looked good before all the eating.</td>', 'I bet it looked good before all the eating.', '2008-11-30 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092064, 742590, 39880, '<td valign="top">That''s a tasty looking dish.  The picture looks just a bit flat.  I think a contrast boost would help.</td>', 'That''s a tasty looking dish.  The picture looks just a bit flat.  I think a contrast boost would help.', '2008-11-30 22:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092066, 742801, 39880, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a feast.  Looks good.  Picture wise, a few hot spots, but I like the colors and layout.</td>', 'Now that''s a feast.  Looks good.  Picture wise, a few hot spots, but I like the colors and layout.', '2008-11-30 22:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092068, 742500, 39880, '<td valign="top">Picture looks great.  The food, not so much.</td>', 'Picture looks great.  The food, not so much.', '2008-11-30 22:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092071, 742644, 39880, '<td valign="top">Now that looks tasty.  As for the picture, looks pretty good.</td>', 'Now that looks tasty.  As for the picture, looks pretty good.', '2008-11-30 22:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092145, 742582, 88136, '<td valign="top">gave this a 6. not sure what i think of the window. i like the dof</td>', 'gave this a 6. not sure what i think of the window. i like the dof', '2008-11-30 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092147, 742676, 88136, '<td valign="top">looks yummy. i dont like the little fellow on top, but i really like the texture in the white frosting stuff in comparison to the gooey fruity stuff(i apologize for not know what kind of cake it is:) border is kinda distracting</td>', 'looks yummy. i dont like the little fellow on top, but i really like the texture in the white frosting stuff in comparison to the gooey fruity stuff(i apologize for not know what kind of cake it is:) border is kinda distracting', '2008-11-30 23:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092514, 742728, 48479, '<td valign="top">Awesome job. The lighting and colours are perfect.</td>', 'Awesome job. The lighting and colours are perfect.', '2008-12-01 00:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5093653, 742542, 39880, '<td valign="top">And a very nice centerpiece it is.  I think the crop is a bit tight.</td>', 'And a very nice centerpiece it is.  I think the crop is a bit tight.', '2008-12-01 08:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5093779, 742582, 81530, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting.</td>', 'Lovely lighting.', '2008-12-01 09:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5093788, 742801, 81530, '<td valign="top">The separation of the food on the plate and the background is a little harsh.</td>', 'The separation of the food on the plate and the background is a little harsh.', '2008-12-01 09:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094490, 742500, 52549, '<td valign="top">The title made me burst out laughing. An extra point for that ;-)</td>', 'The title made me burst out laughing. An extra point for that ;-)', '2008-12-01 12:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094495, 742805, 52549, '<td valign="top">For me, this is exactly the way I''d imagine a feast would be. Very nice.</td>', 'For me, this is exactly the way I''d imagine a feast would be. Very nice.', '2008-12-01 12:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094502, 742701, 52549, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred it without the blue glass (which I find very distracting). Very good title.</td>', 'I''d have preferred it without the blue glass (which I find very distracting). Very good title.', '2008-12-01 12:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094507, 742651, 52549, '<td valign="top">Definitely wouldn''t call you overweight ;-) Hope you enjoyed your feast.</td>', 'Definitely wouldn''t call you overweight ;-) Hope you enjoyed your feast.', '2008-12-01 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094511, 742825, 52549, '<td valign="top">Yes.. doesn''t dpc drive you to drink? ;-)) Very nice image, love the colors.</td>', 'Yes.. doesn''t dpc drive you to drink? ;-)) Very nice image, love the colors.', '2008-12-01 12:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094514, 742826, 52549, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity. Wonder if this is hotpasta...</td>', 'Love the simplicity. Wonder if this is hotpasta...', '2008-12-01 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094519, 742694, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great angle and colors. For some reason, I wish the plate at the front was empty... it seems to take away from the beautiful simplicity or the rest (I know, I know. It wouldn''t be a feast any more ;-)</td>', 'Great angle and colors. For some reason, I wish the plate at the front was empty... it seems to take away from the beautiful simplicity or the rest (I know, I know. It wouldn''t be a feast any more ;-)', '2008-12-01 12:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094527, 742542, 52549, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this is a very nice image but IMO it certainly doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, this is a very nice image but IMO it certainly doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2008-12-01 12:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094529, 742731, 52549, '<td valign="top">The OOF blob of mustard is pretty distracting. I like the focus on the edge of the pastry.</td>', 'The OOF blob of mustard is pretty distracting. I like the focus on the edge of the pastry.', '2008-12-01 12:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094537, 742621, 52549, '<td valign="top">My goodness, did your model actually cook all that?? She looks great, in spite of all the work.</td>', 'My goodness, did your model actually cook all that?? She looks great, in spite of all the work.', '2008-12-01 12:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094559, 742724, 52549, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t mind a bit of criticism. I think your image could have been vastly improved by leaving out the distracting foil in the background (having the background as uncluttered as possible) and by using shiningly clean carving utensils. The color of the meat (poultry?) is wonderful.</td>', 'I hope you don''t mind a bit of criticism. I think your image could have been vastly improved by leaving out the distracting foil in the background (having the background as uncluttered as possible) and by using shiningly clean carving utensils. The color of the meat (poultry?) is wonderful.', '2008-12-01 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094573, 742829, 52549, '<td valign="top">It looks delicious and sort of "olde worlde". I think it might have more impast in b/w. This is really only my opinion, so if you''re sitting on a 7 just ignore me ;-)</td>', 'It looks delicious and sort of "olde worlde". I think it might have more impast in b/w. This is really only my opinion, so if you''re sitting on a 7 just ignore me ;-)', '2008-12-01 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094580, 742547, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. My favourite so far. Hope for top three for you.</td>', 'Gorgeous. My favourite so far. Hope for top three for you.', '2008-12-01 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094696, 742750, 52549, '<td valign="top">Definitely like this a lot. Great toning and idea.</td>', 'Definitely like this a lot. Great toning and idea.', '2008-12-01 13:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094706, 742786, 52549, '<td valign="top">The final flight of the wishbone ;-) Great colors and a very unusual take on the challenge.</td>', 'The final flight of the wishbone ;-) Great colors and a very unusual take on the challenge.', '2008-12-01 13:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094713, 742728, 52549, '<td valign="top">This looks delicious and the colors are wonderful. I''m not crazy about the distracting glasses of liquid in the background. IMO the colour of the liquid clashes with the wonderful colors of the rest (hope you don''t mind a touch of criticism ;-)</td>', 'This looks delicious and the colors are wonderful. I''m not crazy about the distracting glasses of liquid in the background. IMO the colour of the liquid clashes with the wonderful colors of the rest (hope you don''t mind a touch of criticism ;-)', '2008-12-01 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094795, 742826, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, good colours</td>', 'Nice DOF, good colours', '2008-12-01 14:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094796, 742541, 47541, '<td valign="top">Fills the frame nicely, makes the food interesting, would look good in a magazine</td>', 'Fills the frame nicely, makes the food interesting, would look good in a magazine', '2008-12-01 14:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094798, 742728, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great colours, good DOF</td>', 'Great colours, good DOF', '2008-12-01 14:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094852, 742750, 47541, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea and execution - I''m just not 100% taken with the overall colour</td>', 'Wonderful idea and execution - I''m just not 100% taken with the overall colour', '2008-12-01 14:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094859, 742534, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of something other than a plate of food.  Composition seems slightly awkward but still one of my top 5</td>', 'Nice shot of something other than a plate of food.  Composition seems slightly awkward but still one of my top 5', '2008-12-01 14:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094860, 742823, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, fun shot</td>', 'Nice colours, fun shot', '2008-12-01 14:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094863, 742700, 47541, '<td valign="top">DOF is used well to give life to a very dead subject</td>', 'DOF is used well to give life to a very dead subject', '2008-12-01 14:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094867, 742724, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I know it wouldn''t be reality but if you had cleaned the utensils before the shot it would have added that magazine crispness</td>', 'Nice shot, I know it wouldn''t be reality but if you had cleaned the utensils before the shot it would have added that magazine crispness', '2008-12-01 14:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094869, 742801, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but slightly too saturated for my tastes</td>', 'Nice shot but slightly too saturated for my tastes', '2008-12-01 14:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094929, 742694, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and the long exposure.  However the color of the food seems off, perhaps just desaturated, but it makes the food look unappetizing -- which I''m guessing was very appetizing in person!</td>', 'I like your composition and the long exposure.  However the color of the food seems off, perhaps just desaturated, but it makes the food look unappetizing -- which I''m guessing was very appetizing in person!', '2008-12-01 14:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095093, 742728, 51623, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, honestly makes me really hungry.  I like how the smooth lighting really opens up the frame and nice composition as well.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, honestly makes me really hungry.  I like how the smooth lighting really opens up the frame and nice composition as well.', '2008-12-01 15:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095101, 742654, 51623, '<td valign="top">What a bird! I love the candle as the primary light source and it being slightly right of center...nice shot</td>', 'What a bird! I love the candle as the primary light source and it being slightly right of center...nice shot', '2008-12-01 15:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095306, 742653, 77192, '<td valign="top">What''s that red speck on the left? My eye keeps getting drawn to it.</td>', 'What''s that red speck on the left? My eye keeps getting drawn to it.', '2008-12-01 17:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095307, 742825, 77192, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a slight colour cast here, and it seems very dark, but I like your subject matter</td>', 'You''ve got a slight colour cast here, and it seems very dark, but I like your subject matter', '2008-12-01 17:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095311, 742540, 77192, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. It''s very noisy though, and needs better focus. It''s a very appropriate subject matter though, at a time of gratitude for whatever you have</td>', 'Nice idea. It''s very noisy though, and needs better focus. It''s a very appropriate subject matter though, at a time of gratitude for whatever you have', '2008-12-01 17:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095314, 742816, 77192, '<td valign="top">lol cute!</td>', 'lol cute!', '2008-12-01 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095322, 742501, 77192, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to work out what this is. Please let me know or leave your recipe in the comments, this has been bugging me since voting started.<br/> <br/>Colour and exposure seem perfect. It''s quite a tight crop though.</td>', 'I''m trying to work out what this is. Please let me know or leave your recipe in the comments, this has been bugging me since voting started. Colour and exposure seem perfect. It''s quite a tight crop though.', '2008-12-01 17:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095323, 742601, 77192, '<td valign="top">Cute, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'Cute, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge.', '2008-12-01 17:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095324, 742500, 77192, '<td valign="top">Gross lol.</td>', 'Gross lol.', '2008-12-01 17:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095329, 742561, 77192, '<td valign="top">If the Terminator films were about turkeys (and critically speaking the last one was) I sort of imagine this is what they''d look like :-)</td>', 'If the Terminator films were about turkeys (and critically speaking the last one was) I sort of imagine this is what they''d look like :-)', '2008-12-01 17:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095333, 742731, 77192, '<td valign="top">DOF is a bit too shallow for me. Nice clean composition though.</td>', 'DOF is a bit too shallow for me. Nice clean composition though.', '2008-12-01 17:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095335, 742701, 77192, '<td valign="top">lol!</td>', 'lol!', '2008-12-01 17:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095338, 742700, 77192, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer a much looser crop for this.</td>', 'I''d prefer a much looser crop for this.', '2008-12-01 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095340, 742801, 77192, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s a heck of a nice plate of food! Compliments to the chef.<br/> <br/>It''s very noisy though, and the turkey looks washed out. Too much flash?</td>', 'Wow that''s a heck of a nice plate of food! Compliments to the chef. It''s very noisy though, and the turkey looks washed out. Too much flash?', '2008-12-01 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095342, 742676, 77192, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV. What actually is it. Looks nice whatever it is.</td>', 'Interesting POV. What actually is it. Looks nice whatever it is.', '2008-12-01 17:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095345, 742590, 77192, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve shot very wide angle which has given you distortion at the edges. I''d have suggested stepping back and zooming in a bit.</td>', 'It looks like you''ve shot very wide angle which has given you distortion at the edges. I''d have suggested stepping back and zooming in a bit.', '2008-12-01 17:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095346, 742621, 77192, '<td valign="top">My compliments to your model. She looks like she''s made an amazing spread. Is that tomato sauce you have 3 bottles of?</td>', 'My compliments to your model. She looks like she''s made an amazing spread. Is that tomato sauce you have 3 bottles of?', '2008-12-01 17:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095349, 742542, 77192, '<td valign="top">I''d perhaps have cropped less off the top. It''s a stretch for the challenge too.</td>', 'I''d perhaps have cropped less off the top. It''s a stretch for the challenge too.', '2008-12-01 17:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095351, 742694, 77192, '<td valign="top">nice idea with the shutter speed. Good idea to selectively desat your pic to draw attention tot he plate. The only thing is the colour on the plate seems a bit off, slightly pink.</td>', 'nice idea with the shutter speed. Good idea to selectively desat your pic to draw attention tot he plate. The only thing is the colour on the plate seems a bit off, slightly pink.', '2008-12-01 17:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095352, 742787, 77192, '<td valign="top">Very good idea.</td>', 'Very good idea.', '2008-12-01 17:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095353, 742757, 77192, '<td valign="top">too much of a stretch for the challenge for me.</td>', 'too much of a stretch for the challenge for me.', '2008-12-01 17:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095356, 742547, 77192, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little too much DOF for me. I find myself distracted by the background.</td>', 'Perhaps a little too much DOF for me. I find myself distracted by the background.', '2008-12-01 17:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095357, 742823, 77192, '<td valign="top">Wow, well done to whoever baked that amazing cake!</td>', 'Wow, well done to whoever baked that amazing cake!', '2008-12-01 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095363, 742786, 77192, '<td valign="top">I dunno what this background is, but I like it, particularly how the lines cross the lines of the wishbone.<br/> <br/>Did you break it afterwards and wish for a ribbon? ;-)</td>', 'I dunno what this background is, but I like it, particularly how the lines cross the lines of the wishbone. Did you break it afterwards and wish for a ribbon? ;-)', '2008-12-01 17:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095365, 742654, 77192, '<td valign="top">Very profound quote. Not sure I''d have shot this by candlelight though.</td>', 'Very profound quote. Not sure I''d have shot this by candlelight though.', '2008-12-01 17:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095571, 742823, 39880, '<td valign="top">Is that all edible?  Nice looking shot.  The shadow on the left is distracting.  Some nice even lighting would help.</td>', 'Is that all edible?  Nice looking shot.  The shadow on the left is distracting.  Some nice even lighting would help.', '2008-12-01 19:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
