(5101263, 742801, 87808, '<td valign="top">Stuffed pork and roast tatters, I knew I shouldn''t have looked at this shot.  Now my kids are asking who you are and when are we going to your house for dinner.  Is that a glazed carrot over there?  Oh and the photo, pretty darn good, nice crisp and looks appetizing.  Which is hard to do unless you carbon monoxide it.  Nice tones, cheerful dish.  well done 9</td>', 'Stuffed pork and roast tatters, I knew I shouldn''t have looked at this shot.  Now my kids are asking who you are and when are we going to your house for dinner.  Is that a glazed carrot over there?  Oh and the photo, pretty darn good, nice crisp and looks appetizing.  Which is hard to do unless you carbon monoxide it.  Nice tones, cheerful dish.  well done 9', '2008-12-03 10:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5101264, 742582, 87808, '<td valign="top">I think this has great impact as a black and white, the back lighting of the window makes it pop out of the page and insists that you look more closely, I love the darkness that you have at the fore front.  Well done for a smashing shot. 9</td>', 'I think this has great impact as a black and white, the back lighting of the window makes it pop out of the page and insists that you look more closely, I love the darkness that you have at the fore front.  Well done for a smashing shot. 9', '2008-12-03 10:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5101269, 742745, 87808, '<td valign="top">They are certainly are.  Nice brown warm golden tones on the bread and basket, with a pillow of white softness surrounding them.</td>', 'They are certainly are.  Nice brown warm golden tones on the bread and basket, with a pillow of white softness surrounding them.', '2008-12-03 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5101274, 742676, 87808, '<td valign="top">It looks like an interesting cake.  Nice golden colours on the fruit stuff, surrounded by the billowing soft whites that you can feel are soft, with a little tang of burnt.  Nicely done</td>', 'It looks like an interesting cake.  Nice golden colours on the fruit stuff, surrounded by the billowing soft whites that you can feel are soft, with a little tang of burnt.  Nicely done', '2008-12-03 10:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
