(5101283, 742654, 87808, '<td valign="top">Looks like a meal for a King.  A little dark would have liked to have seen the whites pop a tab bit. I adore your title though, very apt</td>', 'Looks like a meal for a King.  A little dark would have liked to have seen the whites pop a tab bit. I adore your title though, very apt', '2008-12-03 10:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
