(5101293, 742825, 87808, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great shot if it had been in focus a little more. There are a lot of yellows competing with each other so maybe bringing out the green would have popped it a little more</td>', 'This would have been a great shot if it had been in focus a little more. There are a lot of yellows competing with each other so maybe bringing out the green would have popped it a little more', '2008-12-03 10:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
