(5101340, 742757, 87808, '<td valign="top">I can see what you are trying to convey here, but all I can see is jaundice looking skin and especially on his tongue  I tell you what though, I bet they are a blast to have at your dinner table, a handful of rascals right there!</td>', 'I can see what you are trying to convey here, but all I can see is jaundice looking skin and especially on his tongue  I tell you what though, I bet they are a blast to have at your dinner table, a handful of rascals right there!', '2008-12-03 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
