(5111075, 742541, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. Pro in every way. My only issue is that the main course isn''t in there. The corn and mashies look great but where''s the Turkey? You have talent with food. Go with it BUT keep in mind the main course is the Rock Star. Cheers!</td>', 'This is a great photo. Pro in every way. My only issue is that the main course isn''t in there. The corn and mashies look great but where''s the Turkey? You have talent with food. Go with it BUT keep in mind the main course is the Rock Star. Cheers!', '2008-12-06 00:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5111092, 742644, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. I love the light breaking through the mashies which is the best lit part of the dish. The bird...the star of the show deserves more light. Square plates are hard to photograph but a slight tilt of the camera can add some movement or a little extra dynamic to the food. Cheers! Great work.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. I love the light breaking through the mashies which is the best lit part of the dish. The bird...the star of the show deserves more light. Square plates are hard to photograph but a slight tilt of the camera can add some movement or a little extra dynamic to the food. Cheers! Great work.', '2008-12-06 00:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
