(5112256, 742500, 68504, '<td valign="top">Actually I think this has great possibilities: using a larger and white and antique (wobbly/crazed) plate/platter and set on a refrectory table with maybe a simple pewter candlestick [none of which I possess], this would be art.  I do have some of your ingredients, and even some drizzle to accomplish this professional haute cuisine glaze.  Seriously.  And I like it.</td>', 'Actually I think this has great possibilities: using a larger and white and antique (wobbly/crazed) plate/platter and set on a refrectory table with maybe a simple pewter candlestick [none of which I possess], this would be art.  I do have some of your ingredients, and even some drizzle to accomplish this professional haute cuisine glaze.  Seriously.  And I like it.', '2008-12-06 14:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
