(5112674, 742728, 59029, '<td valign="top">you give your dog grilled lamb?!  My gawd, man, send it to me next time - I love lamb! Geez!  You Aussies are crazy! :-)<br/> <br/>I gave this shot a 10 and knew it''d be here on the front page.  Makes me hungry just looking at it all over again...and you gave those chops to a dog...</td>', 'you give your dog grilled lamb?!  My gawd, man, send it to me next time - I love lamb! Geez!  You Aussies are crazy! :-) I gave this shot a 10 and knew it''d be here on the front page.  Makes me hungry just looking at it all over again...and you gave those chops to a dog...', '2008-12-06 18:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112732, 742728, 89230, '<td valign="top">Ultimately, I hate you. Now I am hungry. Thanks. I am probably going to go eat now. Again. Then I will have to choose: get fat, or work out. Well, I don''t feel like working out, and I dont feel like being fat. So that is my dilemma. And it is all your fault. I hope you feel some sort of satisfaction out of all of this, because I don''t. <br/> <br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'Ultimately, I hate you. Now I am hungry. Thanks. I am probably going to go eat now. Again. Then I will have to choose: get fat, or work out. Well, I don''t feel like working out, and I dont feel like being fat. So that is my dilemma. And it is all your fault. I hope you feel some sort of satisfaction out of all of this, because I don''t.  Congratulations.', '2008-12-06 19:25:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112753, 742826, 89230, '<td valign="top">So what you are saying is, that you had a fantastic Thanksgiving celebration about killing the Indians and that you feel to express that feeling by eating a dead pumpkin? [shake head, shake head]. <br/> <br/>Congratulations on a tasty (great) photograph!!!</td>', 'So what you are saying is, that you had a fantastic Thanksgiving celebration about killing the Indians and that you feel to express that feeling by eating a dead pumpkin? [shake head, shake head].  Congratulations on a tasty (great) photograph!!!', '2008-12-06 19:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112754, 742750, 89230, '<td valign="top">Are you trying to make me thirsty? Because if you are, then it worked! And if you arnt, well, then thanks. Now I am not only fat, but I have to go to rehab. I hate you....<br/> <br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'Are you trying to make me thirsty? Because if you are, then it worked! And if you arnt, well, then thanks. Now I am not only fat, but I have to go to rehab. I hate you.... Congratulations.', '2008-12-06 19:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112805, 742750, 38248, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  I know exactly what you mean.  It seems the less time, less effort the higher the score??  I''ve noticed the same thing.  It seems that the more effort I spend on a challenge, the lower it pushes me.  Too weird.  Anyway, nice work on this one.</td>', 'Congratulations!  I know exactly what you mean.  It seems the less time, less effort the higher the score??  I''ve noticed the same thing.  It seems that the more effort I spend on a challenge, the lower it pushes me.  Too weird.  Anyway, nice work on this one.', '2008-12-06 20:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112839, 742728, 34114, '<td valign="top">Hey Enzo....Good job on getting 1st place....well deserved I''d say! We Aussies always feast!</td>', 'Hey Enzo....Good job on getting 1st place....well deserved I''d say! We Aussies always feast!', '2008-12-06 21:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5112889, 742547, 97852, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your votes and comments and congrats to the winners.  There were some really good ones  this challenge.</td>', 'Thanks for your votes and comments and congrats to the winners.  There were some really good ones  this challenge.', '2008-12-06 21:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5113418, 742826, 3020, '<td valign="top">That has to be the most perfect way to serve pumpkin pie I have ever seen. Minimal crust, maximum flavor, yummy. Loses a point for what looks like cool whip topping though... it has to be the real stuff for pumpkin pie!!!<br/> <br/>Oh and nice shot :)<br/> <br/>PS- I suppose it could be homemade whipped cream also... I''ll forgive you in that case, but you can''t have the point back, because I umm, Art lost it...</td>', 'That has to be the most perfect way to serve pumpkin pie I have ever seen. Minimal crust, maximum flavor, yummy. Loses a point for what looks like cool whip topping though... it has to be the real stuff for pumpkin pie!!! Oh and nice shot :) PS- I suppose it could be homemade whipped cream also... I''ll forgive you in that case, but you can''t have the point back, because I umm, Art lost it...', '2008-12-07 02:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
